# --- Logs ---
*.log

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Documents / input data ---
# Never commit PDFs or the eval's raw input corpus. The paper corpus is
# rebuilt locally with `python eval/build_dataset.py --download`.
*.pdf
eval/dataset/raw/
eval/dataset/manifest.csv

# --- Docs ---
# Keep README.md tracked; ignore every other Markdown file (deployment notes,
# scratch docs, etc). eval/ is exempted: its Markdown files are eval data
# and deliverables (dataset corpus, report), not scratch notes.
*.md
!README.md
!**/README.md
!eval/**/*.md
# ...but the extracted paper texts in eval/dataset/ are generated input data,
# rebuilt from eval/dataset/raw/*.pdf by `python eval/build_dataset.py`.
eval/dataset/*.md

# Eval: source PDFs are re-fetchable via `python eval/build_dataset.py --download`; caches are local-only
eval/dataset/raw/*.pdf
eval/.cache/
